---
// The "(N)" on an admin tab says HOW MANY items are new since the admin last
// left that tab (admin-tab-views.ts); on its own it never says WHICH ones, so
// opening the tab answered nothing (owner feedback, 2026-07-28). This chip is
// that answer — rendered on every row whose createdAt is past the tab's
// last-viewed boundary, so the count and the rows always agree — including when
// they DISAPPEAR: leaving the tab strips the count, the chips and the
// "חדשים בלבד" toggle together (tab-nav.ts's clearTabBadge), because the panels
// are SSR HTML that a tab switch only shows/hides.
interface Props {
  label?: string;
  /** Put the chip on its own line (a cell too narrow to hold it beside the
   *  value). `block` rather than a `<br />` before it, so removing the chip
   *  can't leave a stray line break behind. */
  block?: boolean;
}
const { label = 'חדש', block = false } = Astro.props;
---

{/* The chip carries its OWN separation from the title it follows (owner, 2026-08-24: *"הן צמודות
    תמיד לכותרת של הכרטיסיה"*). Measured before the change: 6.4px in the stores row (its parent
    flex's `gap`, nothing of the chip's own), ~4px in the sellers card where the parent is plain
    inline flow, and 2.4px above the block form in the alerts table. Three different numbers, all of
    them the row's own spacing between EQUAL siblings — which is the wrong measure here, because a
    title and a mark on it are not siblings of equal weight.

    Here rather than at the four call sites: it is one rule instead of four that drift, and it lands
    on whatever a later panel does with the component without that panel having to know. It ADDS to
    a parent `gap` where one exists (12.4px in stores and orders) and stands alone where none does
    (~10px in sellers) — which is the hierarchy we want either way: more air after the title than
    between the chips that follow it. */}
<span
  class:list={['admin-new-chip', block ? 'block w-fit mt-1.5' : 'inline-block ms-1.5',
    'text-[0.72rem] font-semibold py-[0.2rem] px-[0.55rem] rounded-full whitespace-nowrap bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-success)_15%,transparent)] [color:var(--color-success)]']}
  title="נוסף מאז הפעם האחרונה שיצאת מהלשונית הזו"
>{label}</span>
